WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
No reminder means empty chairs.

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.460
Across twenty one studies,

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.700
about one in five booked

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.180
appointments was missed when nobody

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.460
sent a nudge real money

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:09.660
gone from the day.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.120
Now send one friendly text:

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.020
misses drop from twenty one

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.620
percent to fifteen about a

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.100
quarter fewer no-shows, because three

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.560
of four people read texts

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.900
within five minutes. Do the

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.380
math on your week: reminders

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.720
turn missed slots back into

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.860
paying visits, protecting the booked

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.180
revenue that was about to

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.100
walk out of your door.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.960
Project Knox sends every reminder

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.340
automatically booking, text, follow-up.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.840
Keep more chairs filled and

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.840
your days paid without lifting

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.280
a finger at get project

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.460
knox dot com.

